00&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RSskWjMyyxcQ7kNvwEb-_AJ&_nc_oc=AdqeFW5pLsQ5FCWEXW6WvMKfQSTWgIqdho_QT1iBf3PYDgSjlutT0HJZly49fZ-1LRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJSwzZS3XzVJdivXBZpOXcgE7DqSQOXsmcE_hzXoOlTnw&oe=6AAD32E1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_PointLookout.png", "id": "884501107671984", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300738_884501111005317_4116624426097535501_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rl4k3iijZwUQ7kNvwF5ByWp&_nc_oc=Adrn8PeKuyXoxqFZ6EjnCuHIckSk5q1RLbRWYpMZKzR-Lo8YKIQgm1jfe33u2FZStVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLspL-IgnU-2c9px4T9j2Sx8KqqLfPM1bKOP4w_UEoWGw&oe=6AAD41E5"}, "display_name": "Sea Level Rise Explorer: Point Lookout", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Sea Level Rise Explorer: Point Lookout brings you into Point Lookout State Park through an immersive VR experience built with 360-degree video, aerial drone footage, and interactive 3D models.\n\nFrom above the tree line to ground-level views of campgrounds and shorelines, you can see how sea level rise is already transforming the park, and explore nature-based solutions such as marsh restoration, oyster reefs, and climate-resilient planning.\n\nDesigned as both an educational tool and a platform for public engagement, the experience invites you to explore, interact, and better understand how today\u2019s choices can shape the future of coastal places.", "short_description": "Experience Point Lookout State Park through in immersive VR built with 360-degree video, aerial drone footage, and interactive 3D models. From above the tree line to ground-level views of campgrounds and shorelines, you can see how sea level rise is already transforming the park, and explore nature-based solutions such as marsh restoration, oyster reefs, and climate-resilient infrastructure planning."}]}, "developer_name": null, 